IFC schema definitions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TessIFC generates its schema tables (crates/ifc-schema/src/gen/*.rs) from the
official EXPRESS schema files published by buildingSMART International:

  IFC2X3 TC1, IFC4 ADD2 TC1, IFC4X3 ADD2
  (c) buildingSMART International Ltd.
  https://technical.buildingsmart.org/standards/ifc/ifc-schema-specifications/
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
  (CC BY-ND 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/

The EXPRESS files themselves are not redistributed with this repository. The
committed Rust files are generated tables of names, types, ordering and
inheritance derived from those schemas, attributed here as required.

